        "original_id": "eaccd1fe-0cb5-5d28-8eb4-7d4af1812d6b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rosario Dawson, Rachael Leigh Cook\n- Works: Josie and the Pussycats, Kids, She's All That, Into the West, Perception, Robot Chicken\n- Topics: film premise, acting and voice roles\n\nFacts:\n- Rosario Dawson made her film debut in the 1995 teen drama \"Kids.\"\n- Rachael Leigh Cook was born on October 4, 1979, and she is an American actress, model, voice artist, and producer.\n- Rachael Leigh Cook is known for starring in the films \"She's All That\" (1999) and \"Josie and the Pussycats\" (2001).\n- Rachael Leigh Cook is also known for roles in the television series \"Into the West\" and \"Perception,\" for voice work on \"Robot Chicken,\" and for voicing Tifa Lockhart in the English version of \"Final Fantasy VII: Advent Children.\"\n- \"Josie and the Pussycats\" is about a young all-female band that signs a record contract with a New York City record label and then discovers that the company does not have the musicians' best interests at heart.",
